---
<!-- 10. TRANSPARENCY (A Clearer Way to Build - 3x2 Grid) -->
<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-primary uppercase mb-2 sm:mb-3 block">TRANSPARENCY</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        A CLEARER WAY TO BUILD.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base">
        We believe building a premier property should be an inspiring milestone, not an anxiety-filled endeavor. Our operational transparency keeps you in complete command.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">description</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">01 — Clear Specifications</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Every material grade, tile dimension, paint formulation, and HVAC tonnage is documented and committed in contract writing before ground is broken.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">No Ambiguity</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">event_available</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">02 — Milestone Stages</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Timelines are anchored to concrete progress gates: Foundation complete, Framing poured, Lockup achieved, MEP passed, and Final finishing inspected.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">Guaranteed Milestones</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">inventory_2</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">03 — Material Clarity</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Direct mill-test certifications and physical mockups are submitted for client approval. You know precisely what is installed inside your walls.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">Verified Provenance</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">photo_camera</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">04 — Weekly Updates</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Detailed photographic site journals, aerial drone tracking, and schedule updates sent directly to your portal every single Friday.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">Continuous Visibility</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">fact_check</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">05 — Multi-Stage QA</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Every phase requires a dual sign-off from both our Site Director and Independent Engineering Auditor before proceeding to the next level.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">Dual Sign-Off Gate</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">account_balance_wallet</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">06 — Structured Payments</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Invoices are strictly tied to completed, inspected, and client-verified project milestones. You only pay for executed progress.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-primary uppercase">Progress-Linked Releases</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
